#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD1309 expect=noViolation domain=TS
#note "ADAPTED-FROM the CDISC-CG0276 sister fixture (valid_absent). No TRT record at all -> the Check is the record-present half only (SD1309-F2); with no TSPARMCD=TRT row nothing can fire. The PMDA family has no absent-record sibling rule (unlike CDISC's CG0276-A)."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset TS label="Trial Summary"
col STUDYID  type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN   type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col TSSEQ    type=Num  label="Sequence Number"
col TSPARMCD type=Char label="Trial Summary Parameter Short Name"
col TSPARM   type=Char label="Trial Summary Parameter"
col TSVAL    type=Char label="Parameter Value"
---
S01 | TS | 1 | STYPE | Study Type  | INTERVENTIONAL
S01 | TS | 2 | TITLE | Trial Title | A Study of Drug X
